       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-4BOX-COAXIAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-4BOX-COAXIAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-4BOX-CONCURRENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIRECT-DMA-INFERENCE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-VM-ISOLATION-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UTILITY-INVERSION-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-4BOX-COAXIAL-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-4BOX-COAXIAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-4BOX-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-4BOX-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CONCURRENCY-AND-DMA.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATION-AND-UTILITY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-4BOX-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CONCURRENCY-AND-DMA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-4BOX-CONCURRENCY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIRECT-DMA-INFERENCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATION-AND-UTILITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-VM-ISOLATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UTILITY-INVERSION-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-4BOX-PROOFS.
           IF WS-4BOX-CONCURRENCY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DIRECT-DMA-INFERENCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-VM-ISOLATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-UTILITY-INVERSION-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-4BOX-COAXIAL-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-4BOX-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-4BOX-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-4BOX-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-4BOX-CODE.
